WEBVTT

00:06:58.164 --> 00:07:02.376
We men need to break free from the pack,

00:07:02.376 --> 00:07:06.130
take concrete actions to stop violence,

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:07.339
create safety

00:07:07.339 --> 00:07:08.382
and build equity.

00:07:09.508 --> 00:07:11.385
And most importantly,

00:07:11.385 --> 00:07:12.595
say something.

00:07:13.721 --> 00:07:15.890
To be sure,

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:20.769
bold men around us are actively working
to disrupt the narrative of male toxicity.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.733
After the 2010 earthquake in Haiti,

00:07:25.733 --> 00:07:27.151
a local organization,

00:07:27.151 --> 00:07:28.694
KOFAVIV,

00:07:28.694 --> 00:07:33.324
invited men to be defenders of women
and girls in displacement camps,